@startuml
title reBot-DevArm：SDK 与服务边界
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "业务程序\nPython / C++ / Rust" as application
actor "操作员" as operator
component "官方 SDK\n会话 / 类型 / 错误" as sdk
component "ROS 2 编排\n（可选）" as ros

package "平台服务" as platform {
  component "ArmPlanner\nPinocchio + ProxSuite" as planner
  component "ArmGateway\n控制 / 校验 / 遥测" as gateway
  component "MuJoCo 或设备驱动\n执行 / 接触 / 传感器" as driver
  component "Rerun Viewer\n观察 / 记录 / 回放" as viewer
}

application --> sdk : 调用
ros --> sdk : 编排
sdk --> planner : IK / 轨迹
sdk --> gateway : 控制 / 遥测
planner ..> application : 候选结果
gateway --> driver : SimulationDriver
gateway --> viewer : TelemetryFrame
operator --> viewer : 查看 / 联调
viewer ..> sdk : 控制面板命令

note right of sdk
业务程序只依赖 SDK；
服务内部可独立部署。
end note
@enduml
